  ClarificationResolution signal-spirit:signal:ClarificationResolution
  Supersession signal-spirit:signal:Supersession
  Retirement signal-spirit:signal:Retirement
  SemaReceipt signal-spirit:signal:SemaReceipt
  ClarificationReceipt signal-spirit:signal:ClarificationReceipt
  ClarificationResolutionReceipt signal-spirit:signal:ClarificationResolutionReceipt
  SupersessionReceipt signal-spirit:signal:SupersessionReceipt
  RetirementReceipt signal-spirit:signal:RetirementReceipt
  RecordChangeReceipt signal-spirit:signal:RecordChangeReceipt
